`),"amazon:htmlp":["Build index.html, a front-end for fact-checking Amazon announcements.","A text area to paste the announcement.","A Check button to start.","A results list that marks each claim verified, unverified or unsupported, with its source link next to it.","Keep it to one file, no model calls yet."].join(`
